      "body": "Closing: the frontier question is ANSWERED (PR #437's audit) — the broad-corpus ceiling is the teacher signal (P(next==t_argmax) 6.4% on wiki vs 70.2% home; measured 26% = target-stream ceiling), and the home regime carries a quantified ~16pp representation gap (oracle 52.7 vs measured 36.5). Successors all tracked: #320 = critical path for broad-corpus work (escalated); representation prize = #422 (Ari)/#434/#435; stratification broad-corpus re-measure scoped on #435. No orphans.",
